<title>USA: TENNIS-LIPTON CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LIPTON CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KEY BISCAYNE, Fla. 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$4.45 million Lipton Championships on Saturday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seedings):</p>
<p>Women's Singles, Final:</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat 4-Monica Seles (U.S.)</p>
<p>6-2 6-1</p>
